{"id":70517,"date":"2026-10-23T08:55:43","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T07:55:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70517"},"modified":"2026-10-23T08:58:40","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T07:58:40","slug":"vortex-exclusive-event","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vortex-exclusive-event\/","title":{"rendered":"Vortex Exclusive Event 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Vortex Exclusive Event 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Vortex Exclusive Event 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>25 de outubro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), no cen\u00e1rio exclusivo das fal\u00e9sias sobre o oceano do <strong>W Algarve<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Albufeira<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Faro<\/strong>). Com uma arena limitada a 500 participantes, esta competi\u00e7\u00e3o de fitness h\u00edbrido combina corrida e esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais de alta intensidade num ambiente \u00fanico \u00e0 beira-mar.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Disputado em equipas de 2 atletas (<strong>Doubles<\/strong>) ou de 4 atletas (<strong>Relay<\/strong>), o formato oficial VORTEX contempla <strong>8 rondas<\/strong>: sete voltas de <strong>800 m de corrida<\/strong> alternadas com esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais (1000 m SkiErg, 50 m Sled Push, 80 m Burpee Broad Jump, 1000 m Row, 200 m Farmers Carry, 100 m Sandbag Lunges e 100 repeti\u00e7\u00f5es de Wall Balls), culminando num sprint final de <strong>200 m<\/strong> at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta, al\u00e9m do desafio especial em equipa de 4 workouts em blocos de 8 ou 16 minutos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Promovido pela <strong>VORTEX Hybrid Games<\/strong> segundo os padr\u00f5es t\u00e9cnicos internacionais de corridas h\u00edbridas (com cronometragem por chip em cada esta\u00e7\u00e3o e publica\u00e7\u00e3o de resultados no pr\u00f3prio dia), o evento disp\u00f5e ainda de lounge exclusivo no W Algarve com DJ ao vivo para espectadores. Descobre tamb\u00e9m <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/o-que-e-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">o que \u00e9 o HYROX<\/a> e consulta o calend\u00e1rio completo de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Provas HYROX<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">W Algarve, Albufeira, Faro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Doubles (Equipas de 2) e Relay (Equipas de 4) \u2014 8 Rondas Hybrid Fitness<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">VORTEX Hybrid Games<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/hybridvortex.com\/Vortex_Rulebook_National_DOUBLES_2026_02.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox \/ Fitness Racing<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">VORTEX Doubles (Equipas de 2)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox \/ Fitness Racing<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">VORTEX Relay (Equipas de 4)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Vortex Exclusive Event 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Vortex Exclusive Event 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, no W Algarve, situado sobre as fal\u00e9sias costeiras do concelho de Albufeira, no distrito de Faro, com capacidade de arena para 500 participantes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o formato da competi\u00e7\u00e3o e quais as esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova disputa-se em equipas de 2 (Doubles) ou 4 elementos (Relay) ao longo de 8 rondas: 7 segmentos de 800 m de corrida seguidos de 1. SkiErg (1000 m), 2. Sled Push (50 m \u2014 152 kg M\/Misto, 102 kg F), 3. Burpee Broad Jump (80 m), 4. Row (1000 m), 5. Farmers Carry (200 m \u2014 2&#215;24 kg M\/Misto, 2&#215;16 kg F), 6. Sandbag Lunges (100 m \u2014 20 kg M\/Misto, 10 kg F) e 7. Wall Balls (100 reps \u2014 6 kg M, 4 kg F), terminando na Ronda 8 com um sprint final de 200 m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as regras de proximidade e partilha de trabalho em Doubles?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De acordo com o Rulebook Oficial VORTEX (alinhado com os padr\u00f5es HYROX), os dois atletas da dupla devem correr e entrar\/sair juntos de todas as zonas IN e OUT. Nas esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais, apenas um atleta trabalha de cada vez enquanto o parceiro aguarda na \u00e1rea designada, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio cortarem juntos a meta no sprint final de 200 m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o estado das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e existem passes para espectadores?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As vagas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o para atletas encontram-se encerradas na plataforma oficial. Para o p\u00fablico acompanhante, existem passes di\u00e1rios de espectador (14,99 \u20ac para maiores de 13 anos e entrada gratuita para crian\u00e7as at\u00e9 aos 12 anos) com acesso ao lounge exclusivo do W Algarve e m\u00fasica ao vivo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o livro de regras (Rulebook) e os resultados oficiais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Rulebook oficial completo (Doubles, Solo e Relay) e as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es cronometradas por chip em cada esta\u00e7\u00e3o podem ser consultados no portal oficial da VORTEX Hybrid Games e atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o ao regulamento em PDF dispon\u00edvel nesta p\u00e1gina.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Vortex Exclusive Event 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"endDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"W Algarve, Albufeira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Albufeira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Vortex Exclusive Event 2026 realiza-se a 25 de outubro no W Algarve, em Albufeira. Consulta hor\u00e1rios, formato das esta\u00e7\u00f5es, dorsais e resultados oficiais!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-vortex-exclusive-event.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/hybridvortex.com\/events\/vortex-exclusive-event\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"VORTEX Hybrid Games\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Vortex Exclusive Event 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Vortex Exclusive Event 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, no W Algarve, situado sobre as fal\u00e9sias costeiras do concelho de Albufeira, no distrito de Faro, com capacidade de arena para 500 participantes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o formato da competi\u00e7\u00e3o e quais as esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"